{
    "title": "NBC News: Breaking News & Live",
    "description": "NBC News brings you breaking news, top stories and live news you need to know. Our free news app features real-time news alerts, in-depth stories, exclusive reporting and articles from award-winning journalists covering US news and international news. See the latest on the election directly in the app, including election results by state and county, election maps and polls, and live election updates. Get your daily news fix with topics spanning politics, health news, tech and science news, business, sports, celebrities and entertainment. Get alerted about local news, weather and local headlines from your area. Watch NBC News NOW in the app for 24-hour news coverage, special reports and live streams of current events, and stay up-to-date when news breaks with our live blogs. Watch your favorite primetime and daytime NBC News and MSNBC shows, and listen to a live audio feed of MSNBC with no login required.\r\n\r\nNBC News app features:\r\nBreaking news alerts and push notifications for fast news updates sent straight to your mobile device\r\nPresidential election and state election results, election maps and election polls\r\nExpert opinion and analysis of political news and government news with live commentary from our political correspondents in Washington, D.C.\r\nLocal news and weather alerts from your city and region\r\nNational news and global news reporting at your fingertips, with headline news and top news from America and abroad\r\nWatch live news 24/7 with NBC News NOW and watch live video as events unfold\r\nLivestream full episodes of Meet the Press, NBC Nightly News with Lester Holt and Dateline\r\nBring NBC News NOW and more on the go with streaming live audio (no authentication required!)\r\n\r\nAdditional information:\r\nVideo is accessible via 3G, 4G, LTE and Wi-Fi networks \u2013 data charges may apply\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy?brandA=NBC_News&intake=NBC_News\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?intake=NBC_News\r\nCA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_News\r\nThis app features Nielsen proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. To learn more about our digital measurement products and your choices in regard to them, please visit http://www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "NBC News brings you breaking news, top stories and live news you need to know. Our free news app features real-time news alerts, in-depth stories, exclusive reporting and articles from award-winning journalists covering US news and international news. See the latest on the election directly in the app, including election results by state and county, election maps and polls, and live election updates. Get your daily news fix with topics spanning politics, health news, tech and science news, business, sports, celebrities and entertainment. Get alerted about local news, weather and local headlines from your area. Watch NBC News NOW in the app for 24-hour news coverage, special reports and live streams of current events, and stay up-to-date when news breaks with our live blogs. Watch your favorite primetime and daytime NBC News and MSNBC shows, and listen to a live audio feed of MSNBC with no login required.<br><br>NBC News app features:<br>Breaking news alerts and push notifications for fast news updates sent straight to your mobile device<br>Presidential election and state election results, election maps and election polls<br>Expert opinion and analysis of political news and government news with live commentary from our political correspondents in Washington, D.C.<br>Local news and weather alerts from your city and region<br>National news and global news reporting at your fingertips, with headline news and top news from America and abroad<br>Watch live news 24/7 with NBC News NOW and watch live video as events unfold<br>Livestream full episodes of Meet the Press, NBC Nightly News with Lester Holt and Dateline<br>Bring NBC News NOW and more on the go with streaming live audio (no authentication required!)<br><br>Additional information:<br>Video is accessible via 3G, 4G, LTE and Wi-Fi networks \u2013 data charges may apply<br>Privacy Policy: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy?brandA=NBC_News&amp;intake=NBC_News<br>Your Privacy Choices: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?intake=NBC_News<br>CA Notice: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=NBC_News<br>This app features Nielsen proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. To learn more about our digital measurement products and your choices in regard to them, please visit http://www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.",
